        "original_id": "42b7dfbf-9b81-5dc6-b552-d774313878e9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mel Gibson, Benedict Fitzgerald, Jim Caviezel, Maia Morgenstern, Monica Bellucci, Jan Kounen, Tchéky Karyo, Vincent Cassel, Joël Houssin\n- Films and TV series: The Passion of the Christ, The Matrix Reloaded, The Matrix Revolutions, Malèna, Irréversible, Dobermann, David Nolande\n- Roles: Jesus Christ, Virgin Mary, Mary Magdalene, Persephone, Malèna Scordia, Alex\n\nFacts:\n- In 1997, the French film Dobermann was directed by Jan Kounen and starred Tchéky Karyo, Vincent Cassel, and Monica Bellucci.\n- Joël Houssin wrote the film Dobermann based on his series of police novels.\n- In 2000, Monica Bellucci played Malèna Scordia in the film Malèna.\n- In 2003, Monica Bellucci played Persephone in the science-fiction films The Matrix Reloaded and The Matrix Revolutions.\n- In 2004, The Passion of the Christ was released as an American biblical drama film.\n- The Passion of the Christ was directed by Mel Gibson and written by Mel Gibson and Benedict Fitzgerald.\n- In The Passion of the Christ, Jim Caviezel played Jesus Christ, Maia Morgenstern played the Virgin Mary, and Monica Bellucci played Mary Magdalene.\n- Monica Bellucci also played Alex in the controversial art film Irréversible.\n- Joël Houssin created the crime/fantasy TV series David Nolande.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
